  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Watching the green ghost desert battle, Heavenly Lotus Sect first supreme elder Chen Yi names Chicken Dog Coop and Inquiry Dock high tier rank seven Immortal Gu Houses. He fears that if they join Fallen Flower Hall they will form the battlefield killer move peach blossom maze, trapping him, while Qing Chou inside Divine Bean Palace still cannot use that house’s full power.",
      "chapters": [
        1518
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "char_chen_yi",
        "house_inquiry_dock",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_fallen_flower_hall",
        "char_qing_chou",
        "house_divine_bean_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the three houses are present, Fang Yuan likewise treats them as able to form peach blossom maze, a move famous in his previous life’s five regions chaotic war and stressed in Shadow Sect information. The house has a strange design: two buildings side by side, the left yellow with a round plaque reading chicken, the right red with a plaque reading dog.",
      "chapters": [
        1519
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Hua Sheng later leaves Fallen Flower Hall and enters Chicken Dog Coop during talks with Fang Yuan, and Fang Di Chang plans to repair Fallen Flower Hall then combine all three houses into peach blossom maze to trap Divine Bean Palace.",
      "chapters": [
        1520
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_hua_sheng",
        "char_fang_di_chang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the Refinement Path Convention battlefield, Fang Yuan again describes the paired chicken and dog buildings and states that Chicken Dog Coop focuses on enslavement path, enslaving chickens and dogs, at the same rank seven tier as Canary Pavilion. Fang clan releases large numbers of ancient desolate beast dogs and chickens from the house in that fight.",
      "chapters": [
        1708
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "enslavement-specialty",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_refinement_path_convention",
        "house_canary_pavilion",
        "fac_fang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Chicken Dog Coop is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile equipment of Fang clan, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "enslavement-specialty",
